@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@supplierId = 678

### Buscar proveedores
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers?q=INTERLOMAS&status=all&page=1&pageSize=25

### Primer proveedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/first

### Ficha
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}

### Anterior / siguiente
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/previous

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/next

### Acciones: clasificar, bloqueo, descuentos, eventos, varios y contactos
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/classifications?position=1

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/block-status

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/discounts

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/events

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/various

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/contacts

### Consultas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/balance

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/movements

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/invoices

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/products/ordered

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/fill-rate

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/products/quoted

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/products/purchased

